# Implementation deliverable submitted with the thesis.
#
#   SGX_Verifier/   verification inside an Intel SGX enclave
#   no_enclave/     the native baseline every measurement is compared against
#
# Both trees hold a modified ACA-Py 1.6.0. Only build outputs, generated
# deployment state and caches are excluded; everything else is tracked.

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.eggs/
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/*.egg

# Gramine build outputs (regenerated by the two-step build; the
# .manifest.template source is tracked).
**/*.manifest
**/*.manifest.sgx
**/*.sig
**/*.token

# Wallet databases, generated keys, and certificates.
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.pem
**/ratls.*

# Environment-specific generated state (regenerated per deployment).
**/verifier_config.json
**/verifier_did.json
**/registry.json

# OS / editor files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*~

# Logs
**/log/
**/*.log
